# main-tema-sprint: the real main screen under the shipped "Sprint" theme
# (rootfs/usr/share/x6200/themes/Sprint.json: deep navy, amber focus, ice-cyan
# readings, Roboto Condensed and DSEG14 for the digit panels — the theme names
# `font_digits`, so the frequency row and the clock draw segmented here without
# the fixture asking for `digits`). Same radio state as home-usb-20m, so the
# theme is the only variable: the render is Sprint's identity of the main screen
# (frequency row, mode, VFO, S-meter, band plan and waterfall).
#
# It is also the fixture of the non-text contract for Sprint (`s_meter_arc` and
# `waterfall_signal` in tools/ab_testing/quality/nontext.yaml, WCAG 1.4.11 over
# its committed golden render).

name main-tema-sprint
screen main

theme Sprint
seed 21

frequency_hz 14074000
tx_frequency_hz 14074000
fft_width_hz 384000

mode usb
vfo A
agc auto

split false
att false
pre false
atu false
ant 1

smeter_db -73

battery_v 12.1
external_v 13.8
battery_cap 76
charging false

rxtx rx
